$\begin{align*}y_1&=2^2-2(2)+3\\&=3\\f'(x)&=2x-2\\m_t&=f'(2)=2\\m_n&=-\frac{1}{2}\end{align*}$
The normal passes through $(2,3)$.
$\begin{align*}y-3&=-\frac12(x-2)\\y-3&=-\frac{x}{2}+1\\y&=-\frac{x}{2}+4\\x+2y-8&=0\end{align*}$
The red tangent and green normal meet at the point of contact.
